### 学生提交订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Idempotency-Key: 9a7c2b10-6d34-4e81-a5f2-123456789abc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupDate": "2026-11-27",
  "pickupSlot": "LUNCH",
  "remark": "少辣"
}

### 使用相同幂等键重复提交订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Idempotency-Key: 7f8e1c60-8fe2-49a1-9e31-0123456789ab
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupDate": "2026-11-27",
  "pickupSlot": "LUNCH",
  "remark": "少辣"
}

### 查询当前学生的订单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 查询订单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 取消自己的订单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 重复取消已经取消的订单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}